ÿØÿÛ«symbol SR-flop-B-source
  «type: X»
  «description: B-source SR-flop / SR Flip flop [level trigger]»
  «library file: |.subckt SR-flop-B-source S R Q ¬Q\nB1 Q 0 V=if(((V(S)>thre)&(V(R)<=thre)),1, if(((V(S)<=thre)&(V(R)>thre)),0, if(((V(S)<=thre)&(V(R)<thre)),V(memory),V(restricted)) ) )\nB2 memory 0 V=if(time<=0,IC,state(1,V(Q)))\nB3 ¬Q 0 V=!V(Q)\nB4 restricted 0 V=if(restricted==-1,V(memory),if(restricted==0,0,1))\n.ends SR-flop-B-source»
  «shorted pins: false»
  «line (400,200) (300,200) 0 0 0xc000 -1 2»
  «line (400,-200) (300,-200) 0 0 0xc000 -1 3»
